@title Help icons: Parts and Macros carry no explanation text
@area Parts
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The notes of the Parts window, the Place macro window and the Macros window sit behind the ? of each window; check_text fails on any label of more than 20 words (the target is 8).
fresh
key ctrl+k
text "parts"
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
shot parts-empty
check_text 20
check_layout
key ctrl+k
text "place macro"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
shot place-macro-empty
check_text 20
check_layout
